# Nothing a user owns is written inside this checkout any more: history, the
# plugin registry, generated tool files, fetched completions and module state
# all live in YOUR config directory (see docs/layout.md). If any of them turn
# up in here, the split has come undone — run `nu install.nu`.

# Plugin binaries belong in YOUR plugins/ directory, never here: they are
# per-platform and tied to the nu-plugin protocol version (docs/plugins.md).

.DS_Store
*.bak

# `.claude/` is a session's own: on a developer's machine it is a symlink to
# a worktree of their Claude Code config (ctx-flow), never the checkout's.
# The skills the distro ships for a session live in harness/claude-code/.
.claude
# ast-grep's registry of locally built grammars (`/ctx-grammar nu`): it names
# a path under ~/.cache, so it is one machine's, never the checkout's.
sgconfig.yml
